1
00:00:00,167 --> 00:00:01,893
Negara ini tidak punya laut.

2
00:00:01,913 --> 00:00:04,127
Tapi punya angkatan laut,

3
00:00:04,147 --> 00:00:05,210
dengan sekitar lima ribu

4
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:05,957
personel.

5
00:00:05,977 --> 00:00:07,094
Ini Bolivia.

6
00:00:07,114 --> 00:00:09,679
Saat merdeka tahun 1825,

7
00:00:09,699 --> 00:00:11,537
Bolivia mengklaim pantai di

8
00:00:11,557 --> 00:00:12,962
Samudra Pasifik,

9
00:00:12,982 --> 00:00:14,817
lewat Gurun Atacama.

10
00:00:14,837 --> 00:00:17,015
Tahun 1879,

11
00:00:17,035 --> 00:00:18,625
sengketa pajak dan sumber daya

12
00:00:18,645 --> 00:00:20,126
memicu Perang Pasifik.

13
00:00:20,146 --> 00:00:21,860
Bolivia dan Peru melawan

14
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:22,889
Chile.

15
00:00:22,909 --> 00:00:23,942
Chile menang,

16
00:00:23,962 --> 00:00:25,273
dan seluruh pantai Bolivia

17
00:00:25,293 --> 00:00:26,151
lepas.

18
00:00:26,171 --> 00:00:27,714
Perjanjian 1904

19
00:00:27,734 --> 00:00:28,473
mengesahkannya.

20
00:00:28,493 --> 00:00:29,634
Sebagai gantinya,

21
00:00:29,654 --> 00:00:30,980
Chile membangun rel kereta

22
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,219
dari Arica ke La Paz,

23
00:00:32,239 --> 00:00:33,689
dan Bolivia boleh berdagang

24
00:00:33,709 --> 00:00:34,858
lewat pelabuhan Chile.

25
00:00:34,878 --> 00:00:36,390
Tapi Bolivia tidak pernah

26
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:37,288
melupakan lautnya.

27
00:00:37,308 --> 00:00:38,573
Tahun 1963,

28
00:00:38,593 --> 00:00:39,533
mereka membentuk pasukan

29
00:00:39,553 --> 00:00:40,833
sungai dan danau.

30
00:00:40,853 --> 00:00:41,638
Kini angkatan lautnya

31
00:00:41,658 --> 00:00:42,815
berpatroli di sungai-sungai

32
00:00:42,835 --> 00:00:44,842
Amazon dan di Danau Titicaca,

33
00:00:44,862 --> 00:00:47,582
3.812 meter di atas permukaan

34
00:00:47,602 --> 00:00:47,974
laut.

35
00:00:47,994 --> 00:00:49,184
Setiap 23 Maret,

36
00:00:49,204 --> 00:00:50,592
Bolivia memperingati Día del

37
00:00:50,612 --> 00:00:52,133
Mar, Hari Laut.

38
00:00:52,153 --> 00:00:53,510
Angkatan lautnya berparade,

39
00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:55,337
dan tuntutan akses ke laut

40
00:00:55,357 --> 00:00:56,315
diulang lagi.

41
00:00:56,335 --> 00:00:57,971
Tahun 2013,

42
00:00:57,991 --> 00:00:59,380
Bolivia menggugat Chile ke

43
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,696
Mahkamah Internasional.

44
00:01:00,716 --> 00:01:02,739
Satu Oktober 2018,

45
00:01:02,759 --> 00:01:04,148
putusannya keluar:

46
00:01:04,168 --> 00:01:05,456
Chile tidak wajib berunding.

47
00:01:05,476 --> 00:01:07,345
Lautnya lepas hampir 150 tahun

48
00:01:07,365 --> 00:01:09,598
lalu, tapi angkatan lautnya

49
00:01:09,618 --> 00:01:10,248
tetap berlayar,

50
00:01:10,268 --> 00:01:11,367
menjaga harapan.

51
00:01:11,387 --> 00:01:11,847
Menurut kamu,

52
00:01:11,867 --> 00:01:12,605
ini keras kepala,

53
00:01:12,625 --> 00:01:14,217
atau kesetiaan pada sejarah?

